        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Storeroom Function Lever for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a Narrow Escutcheon Plate Storeroom Function Lever (Outside entrance by lever only when released by key)  is suitable for all Wide, Medium and <b>Narrow Stile Doors</b> \r\n(storefront glass doors, aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200r\"><b>4200 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-commercial-vertical-rod-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-4200v\"><b>4200 Series Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>, \r\n Global <a href=\"/products/36-inch-narrow-stile-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-global-th1100-sted36\"><b>TH1100-STED Touch Bar Rim Exit Device for Narrow Stile Doors</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/30-to-36-inch-wide-door-touch-bar-rim-exit-device-th1100edtbar\"><b>TH1100EDTBAR Touch Bar Rim Exit Devices</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 4-EN-09-PHL Keyed Storeroom Function Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Storeroom Function (ANSI F09) - Outside entrance by lever only when released by key (Lever only opens door when the key is turned). Key removable only when locked.</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Height: 6-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with Schlage \"C\" Keyway Lock Cylinder and 2 Keys</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/429LPEKX-temp.pdf?v=1704262244\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 4-EN-09-PHL Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>",
